sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design from ADR 0244: native Swamp schedules, nothing installed on the Node; DECISIONS R1-R3.
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Target Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: schedule:run<br/>{schedule: 7f3c…}
  Note over GW: Admit a task from template<br/>trigger: operator · #5130
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>task-command-run · vault key name
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5130
  SW->>N: Check account, directory<br/>getent, test -d, @swamp/ssh
  SW->>N: Verify the command hash<br/>stdin: vault.get(command key)
  SW->>N: Run the command<br/>sudo -u user, timeout, stdin
  alt exit 0 in budget
    N-->>SW: exit 0, output
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event, run reader
    Note over GW: Close the task<br/>output in the Swamp step
  else fails or times out
    N--xSW: exit ≠ 0 or timeout
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code, failed step
    Note over GW: Mark the task failed<br/>timer state unchanged
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5130
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
